<title>USA: RAC Financial sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>RAC Financial sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>RAC Financial Group Inc said Friday it had approved a 2-for-1 common stock split.</p>
<p>The split, effectuated as a stock dividend of one newly issued share of common stock for each share of common stock outstanding, is effective for shareholders of record at the close of business on November 15 and payable on November 29.</p>
</text>
